        {
          "text": "TAI Hsi 戴熙 (T. 醕士, 蒓涘, H. 鹿牀, 東井居士), 1801–1860, Mar. 21, painter and official, was a native of Ch'ien-t'ang (Hangchow). In 1819 he became a chü-jên and in 1832 a chin-shih with appointment to the Hanlin Academy.",
